  "body": "ea_non_iid hangs on the Tuple Estimates when processing the following\r\n8MB file.\r\n\r\nA10.bin (8MB) is uploaded to the ESV demo server (/esvp/v1/entropyAssessments/1393/dataFiles/3290)\r\n\r\nThe following command hangs:\r\n  ea_non_iid -i -a -v A10.bin 8\r\n\r\nThe following command passes:\r\n  ea_non_iid -i -a -v -l 0,1000000 A10.bin 8\r\n\r\nThe following command hangs:\r\n  ea_non_iid -i -a -v -l 2,1000000 A10.bin 8",
